        "text": "radialOp d vr F p = fderiv ℝ F p ((1,0),(0,0)) + radialSpeed d p.1.1 * (vr.1 * fderiv ℝ F p ((0,0),(1,0)) + vr.2 * fderiv ℝ F p ((0,0),(0,1))); docstring \"This is exactly ∂r + d r^(d-1) (vr · ∂Y)\""
